<title>SINGAPORE: Freight Links 1997 net rises 26.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Freight Links 1997 net rises 26.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended April 30 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		5.52  vs   4.36</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)  4.08  vs   5.01</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)    8.00  vs   5.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		177.39  vs  80.42</p>
<p>    Operating profit     15.74  vs   8.95</p>
<p>    Interest expense	3.29  vs   1.10</p>
<p>    Pretax		    7.95  vs   5.79</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.63  vs   1.42</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 2.04  vs    nil</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Freight Links Express Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
